        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "`code/main.py` runs a 3-agent \u00d7 3-round debate on a math question where each agent starts with a different (possibly wrong) answer. Agents are scripted \u2014 each \"updates\" by averaging the neighbors' answers weighted by a scripted confidence. Convergence is visible in the round-by-round log."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "The demo shows two key effects:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "- A single round of exchange moves agents closer to the correct answer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "- Extra rounds past round 2 show diminishing returns (matches Du et al.'s plateau)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Run:"
      ]
    },
    {
